      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's getting a little more tender when i press on the right side but it's not like a sharp pain yet. i think i'll just do the 800mg and call it a night. u think its okay to also take some of my prescription strength stuff for the nausea if i start feeling sick later? i have some oxycontin from a dental thing i still have a few left over i could just use that to numb the pain so i can sleep better.",
